{"id":"00065","root":"uni00065_1","name":{"ja":"喜瀬　蛍","en":"Kise Hotaru"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"喜瀬　蛍","en":"Kise Hotaru"},"aliases":["Kise"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-10-19","limited":false,"characterId":58,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園在籍の対魔忍。明るく、面倒見のよい性格で、丁寧な物腰。その性格の良さで、自然と周りには人が集まる。特異な能力と、その汎用性から、一部戦闘任務にも抜擢されている。ただし、まだまだ半人前なので、一人で任務をこなす事ができず、人知れず特訓を行っている。本当は争いごとは嫌いだが、魔族や魔界技術を悪用する者を放置する事が許せず、任務をこなしている。八津紫にあこがれを持っており、授業が終わると暇があれば紫に特訓を受けている。戦斧も紫にあこがれて使いはじめたもの。大きく破壊力のある武器は能力との相性も良かったため、その後も使いつづけているが、運搬がしづらいのが難点。","en":"Kise Hotaru is a Taimanin enrolled at Gosha Academy. She has a bright, caring personality and a polite demeanor, which naturally draws people to her. Because of her unique abilities and their versatility, she is sometimes selected for combat missions. However, she is still inexperienced and cannot handle missions alone, so she trains in secret. Although she truly dislikes conflict, she cannot tolerate those who misuse demons or Demon Realm technology, and she fulfills her duties. She admires Yatsu Murasaki and, whenever she has free time after classes, receives extra training from her. Inspired by Yatsu Murasaki, she also began wielding a battle axe. The weapon's massive destructive power meshes well with her abilities, so she continues to use it, though its bulk makes transportation difficult."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"沢代りず","forms":[{"id":"uni00065_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1164,2328],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[178,356],"def":[130,260],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","30004"]},{"id":"uni00065_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1728,3456],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[281,562],"def":[185,370],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","30004","30005"]},{"id":"uni00065_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2292,4585],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[384,767],"d